{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe heat here is oppressive, though the air is dry. Today I finished my surveys of the galleries. The lighting is poor, and the guides are tedious, but the works themselves are sufficient. At noon I dined with the von H. family. Their table was heavy, the wine flat, but they are polite enough. They drove us to the Pleasure Garden outside the city. I confess I have little patience for such public amusements; the crowds are thick and the music shrill. I sat in a shaded corner, ate a cold chicken, and paid two florins for the privilege of standing near a fountain. The uncle’s son spoke of politics with the confidence of a boy who has never had to pay for his opinions. I let him.\n\nI hope the boys are behaving. I shall dine with them again tomorrow, then move on. Do not worry; I am well, if somewhat tired.\n\nYour\nG. W. F. H."}}],"created":1795219377,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":204,"prompt_tokens":1115,"total_tokens":1319,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-iVgWMIk4V0bFZ1djPqbZGuWXd4vYcR0J","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1115,"prompt_ms":1059.015,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9497892376681615,"prompt_per_second":1052.8651624386812,"predicted_n":204,"predicted_ms":4805.249,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.671177339901476,"predicted_per_second":42.24546948555632}}